        "width": 88.0,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "按逻辑块读写；主机检查响应、CRC 与超时。",
        "width": 443.46,
        "allocated": 585,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "DAT0 可指示忙；无 AXI 式逐拍 VALID / READY。",
        "width": 472.79,
        "allocated": 585,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "初始化",
        "width": 66.0,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "识别器件 → 读取能力 → CMD6 配置总线与模式。",
        "width": 488.32,
        "allocated": 585,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "先低速初始化，再切 8-bit / High Speed 并提高 CLK。",
        "width": 522.87,
        "allocated": 585,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
