        "width": 88.0,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "CMD18 多块读 → 接收数据 → DMA 写 DDR。",
        "width": 448.16,
        "allocated": 585,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "命令响应 ≠ 搬运完成；检查错误后校验参数包。",
        "width": 471.5,
        "allocated": 585,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "模式边界",
        "width": 88.0,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "当前建议 SDR：每周期每根数据线传 1 bit。",
        "width": 428.87,
        "allocated": 585,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
