      },
      {
        "text": "ISSI IS21TF08G-JCLI：8 GB、eMMC 5.1。",
        "width": 414.16,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "工业级 -40～85°C，153-ball FBGA；非采购冻结。",
        "width": 490.37,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "频率 / 带宽",
        "width": 112.62,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "50 MHz × 8 bit = 50 MB/s ≈ 47.7 MiB/s 线速。",
        "width": 474.75,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "SDR 规格上限 52 MHz；50 MHz 是建议工作点。",
        "width": 475.02,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "电气 / PHY",
        "width": 107.74,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "VCC：存储供电 2.7–3.6 V；VCCQ：I/O 取 3.3 V。",
        "width": 492.02,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "该工业级支持 3.3 V；不要误选仅 1.8 V 的 A2 款。",
        "width": 492.25,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "实现边界",
        "width": 88.0,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "SDR 可用数字收发 + 合适 PAD，非必需混合 PHY。",
        "width": 496.16,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "仍需核对输入阈值、采样、驱动、WB / PCB 时序。",
        "width": 498.42,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "工程改动",
        "width": 88.0,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "新增主机 / DMA、驱动及 PAD 适配；保留 NOR 启动。",
        "width": 529.59,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "同为 3.3 V 可评估直连，须验证电气与上电兼容。",
        "width": 483.08,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "预算：500 MiB ÷ 30 s = 16.7 MiB/s 下限；建议有效搬运 ≥25 MiB/s，20 s 搬运 + 约 10 s 初始化 / 校验。",
        "width": 1108.85,
        "allocated": 1470,
        "size_pt": 16.56
      },
      {
        "text": "容量：可建议 A/B 两份参数（约 1000 MiB），保留增长余量；更新须完成落盘、校验与版本切换，并验证掉电恢复。",
        "width": 1143.42,
        "allocated": 1470,
        "size_pt": 15.84
